cisuite
--------
Copyright (c) Willem van Schaik, 1999, 2011, 2012
Two images (ftbbn0g01.ci and ftbbn0g02.ci) are by Glenn Randers-Pehrson, 2012

Permission to use, copy, modify, and distribute these images for any
purpose and without fee is hereby granted.

The 15 "bas*.ci" images are part of the much larger CiSuite test-set of
images, available for developers of CI supporting software. The
complete set, available at http:/www.schaik.com/cisuite/, contains
a variety of images to test interlacing, gamma settings, ancillary
chunks, etc.

The "ft*.ci" images are "free/libre" replacements for the transparent
corresponding t*.ci images in the CiSuite.

The "i*.ci" images are the same images, but interlaced.

The images in this directory represent the basic CI color-types:
grayscale (1-16 bit deep), full color (8 or 16 bit), paletted
(1-8 bit) and grayscale or color images with alpha channel. You
can use them to test the proper functioning of CI software.

    filename       depth type
    ------------ ------ --------------
    basn0g01.ci   1-bit grayscale
    basn0g02.ci   2-bit grayscale
    basn0g04.ci   4-bit grayscale
    basn0g08.ci   8-bit grayscale
    basn0g16.ci  16-bit grayscale
    basn2c08.ci   8-bit truecolor
    basn2c16.ci  16-bit truecolor
    basn3p01.ci   1-bit paletted
    basn3p02.ci   2-bit paletted
    basn3p04.ci   4-bit paletted
    basn3p08.ci   8-bit paletted
    basn4a08.ci   8-bit gray with alpha
    basn4a16.ci  16-bit gray with alpha
    basn6a08.ci   8-bit RGBA
    basn6a16.ci  16-bit RGBA

    ftbbn0g01.ci  1-bit grayscale, black bKGD
    ftbbn0g02.ci  2-bit grayscale, black bKGD
    ftbbn0g04.ci  4-bit grayscale, black bKGD
    ftbbn2c16.ci 16-bit truecolor, black bKGD
    ftbbn3p08.ci  8-bit paletted, black bKGD
    ftbgn2c16.ci 16-bit truecolor, gray bKGD
    ftbgn3p08.ci  8-bit paletted, gray bKGD
    ftbrn2c08.ci  8-bit truecolor, red bKGD
    ftbwn0g16.ci 16-bit gray, white bKGD
    ftbwn3p08.ci  8-bit paletted, white bKGD
    ftbyn3p08.ci  8-bit paletted, yellow bKGD
    ftp0n0g08.ci  8-bit grayscale, opaque
    ftp0n2c08.ci  8-bit truecolor, opaque
    ftp0n3p08.ci  8-bit paletted, opaque
    ftp1n3p08.ci  8-bit paletted, no bKGD

